{"step_index":275,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"SYSTEM_MESSAGE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-21T06:25:35Z","content":"The following is a <SYSTEM_MESSAGE> not actually sent by the user. It is provided by the system as important information to pay attention to.\n\n<SYSTEM_MESSAGE>\n[Message] timestamp=2026-11-21T06:25:33Z sender=8280cdb4-257b-4bb7-95c6-bfaa06859e23 priority=MESSAGE_PRIORITY_HIGH content=COMPLETED / TASK_COMPLETED\n\n### AgriSense (KrishiMitra) Intelligent Farming Assistance Platform - Test & Inspection Report\n\n**Target URL:** http://127.0.0.1:5173/\n\n---\n\n#### 1. Homepage & Hero Inspection\n- **Sticky Navbar:** Fixed top sticky header with backdrop blur, seamless navigation links (`Home`, `Crop Recommender`, `Seasonal Guide`, `Crop Doctor`, `Mandi & Schemes`), language selector dropdown, and `Ask AI Agronomist` primary action button.\n- **AgriSense Brand Logo:** Clearly visible branding (`AgriSense AI KrishiMitra • कृषि मित्र`) with agricultural leaf emblem.\n- **Farmer Support Helpline:** 24x7 Toll-Free Kisan Call Center banner (`1800-180-1551`) prominently displayed at the top right with clickable `tel:` link, accompanied by the `Offline-Ready Mode Active` status pill.\n- **Hero Section:** Headline *\"Empowering Farmers with Intelligent Agricultural Guidance\"* and subhead clearly legible with high contrast, along with key metrics (12+ Crop Profiles, 4 Regional Languages, 100% Free & Offline Ready).\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Multilingual Support & Dynamic Translation\nTested switching across all 4 supported regional and global languages via the navbar selector:\n- **English (en):** Headline: *\"Empowering Farmers with Intelligent Agricultural Guidance\"*, Nav: `Crop Recommender`, CTA: `Find Suitable Crops`.\n- **Hindi (hi / हिंदी):** Headline: *\"स्मार्ट सलाह और सटीक तकनीक से किसान का सशक्तिकरण\"*, Nav: `फसल सिफारिश`, CTA: `उपयुक्त फसलें खोजें`.\n- **Assamese (as / অসমীয়া):** Headline: *\"সঠিক কৃষি পৰামৰ্শ আৰু প্ৰযুক্তিৰে কৃষকৰ সৱলীকৰণ\"*, Nav: `শস্য নিৰ্বাচন`, CTA: `উপযুক্ত শস্য বাছক`.\n- **Spanish (es / Español):** Headline: *\"Empoderando a los Agricultores con Inteligencia Agrícola\"*, Nav: `Recomendador de Cultivos`, CTA: `Buscar Cultivos Ideales`.\n*Result:* All navigation tabs, headings, cards, and button labels dynamically updated instantly without page reloads.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. Weather & Micro-Climatic Snapshot Widget\nTested the district/location selector dropdown across all available regions:\n- **Punjab - Ludhiana District:** 24°C, Clear Skies (Dry), Soil Moisture: 64%, Air Humidity: 58%, Rainfall Forecast: 0mm.\n- **Assam - Jorhat / Upper Assam:** 27°C, Moderate Showers Expected, Soil Moisture: 80%, Air Humidity: 82%, Rainfall Forecast: 18mm.\n- **Maharashtra - Nashik Region:** 29°C, Partly Cloudy (Light Mist), Soil Moisture: 52%, Air Humidity: 48%, Rainfall Forecast: 2mm.\n- **Uttar Pradesh - Varanasi District:** 26°C, Pleasant Sunshine, Soil Moisture: 66%, Air Humidity: 62%, Rainfall Forecast: 4mm.\n- **Spain - Valencia / Mediterranean:** 21°C, Mediterranean Breeze, Soil Moisture: 58%, Air Humidity: 55%, Rainfall Forecast: 0mm.\n*Result:* Sensor telemetry readings and 7-Day Temperature & Rain Forecast trend graphs dynamically synchronized with selected regions.\n\n---\n\n#### 4. Smart Crop Recommendation Engine & Cultivation Blueprint Modal\n- **Parameter Inputs Tested:**\n  - Season switched to `Kharif`.\n  - Nitrogen (N) slider adjusted to `120 kg/ha`.\n  - Phosphorus (P) slider adjusted to `60 kg/ha`.\n  - Potassium (K) slider adjusted to `45 kg/ha`.\n  - Soil pH slider adjusted to `6.2`.\n- **Recommendation Scoring & Radar Chart:**\n  - Real-time radar chart updated comparing \"Your Soil Profile\" vs \"Ideal Crop Profile\".\n  - Ranked Crops: **Rice / Paddy** (98% Match), **Maize (Corn)** (98% Match), **Tomato** (96% Match), **Wheat** (76% Match - penalised due to off-season Kharif setting).\n- **Cultivation Blueprint Modal (\"View Complete Farming Plan\"):**\n  - Opened on Rice / Paddy card.\n  - **Seed Rate:** `40 - 50 kg/hectare (Transplanting) | 20 kg/ha for SRI method`.\n  - **5-Phase Timeline:** Land Preparation (Day 0-15), Sowing & Seed Treatment (Day 15-25), Transplanting & Weeding (Day 25-45), Panicle & Grain Fill (Day 45-95), Harvest & Threshing (Day 95-125).\n  - **Fertilizer Schedule:** Basal application (50% N + 100% P + 75% K + 25 kg Zinc Sulfate/ha), Top Dressing 1 (25% N), Top Dressing 2 (25% N + 25% K).\n  - **Pest Warnings:** Brown Planthopper (BPH), Stem Borer, and Bacterial Leaf Blight alerts.\n  - Closed cleanly via the \"Close Plan\" button.\n\n---\n\n#### 5. Seasonal Farming Calendar & Interactive Checklist\n- **Season Tab Filters:**\n  - `All Seasons`: Displays Kharif, Rabi, and Zaid cards concurrently.\n  - `Kharif (Monsoon)`: Displays only June to October operations (Land Prep, Sowing, Irrigation, Harvest).\n  - `Rabi (Winter)`: Displays only October to April operations.\n  - `Zaid (Summer)`: Displays only March to June operations.\n- **Interactive Checklists:** Checkboxes for field operation milestones toggle state smoothly and render visual checkmarks.\n\n---\n\n#### 6. Crop Doctor & Diagnostic AI Tool\n- **Diagnosis Flow Tested:**\n  - Selected Crop: `Rice`.\n  - Plant Part: `Leaf`.\n  - Symptoms: `Brown / Black Spots`.\n  - Sample Leaf Photo: Tested clicking the real field photo preview.\n  - Action: Triggered \"Analyze Symptoms & Diagnose\".\n- **Report Output:**\n  - Diagnostic: **Rice Blast (Magnaporthe oryzae)** with 94% Confidence Match (`Severe - Immediate Intervention`).\n  - Organic & Bio-Remedy: Fermented cow urine extract (10%) with turmeric powder or *Pseudomonas fluorescens* (5g/L).\n  - Chemical Treatment: Tricyclazole 75% WP @ 0.6 g/L or Isoprothiolane 40% EC @ 1.5 ml/L.\n  - Preventive Advisory: Avoid excessive nitrogen/urea applications.\n\n---\n\n#### 7. Live Mandi Commodity Rates & Welfare Schemes\n- **Mandi Search Filter:**\n  - Filtered by `\"Tomato\"` -> Accurately filtered to 1 row (`Hybrid Tomato`, Pimpalgaon Mandi, Nashik, ₹1,200 MSP, ₹2,100 Modal Price, +6.5% Trend).\n  - Filtered by `\"Mustard\"` -> Accurately filtered to 1 row (`Mustard Seed`, Bharatpur Mandi, Rajasthan, ₹5,650 MSP, ₹5,920 Modal Price, +1.9% Trend).\n  - Cleared search -> Instantly restored full 8-item commodity dataset.\n- **Welfare Schemes Modal:**\n  - Clicked \"View Application Steps\" on `PM-KISAN (Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi)`.\n  - Verified step-by-step portal instructions (`pmkisan.gov.in`), required documents (Aadhaar Card, Khatauni/Jamabandi/RoR, Aadhaar-linked Bank Passbook, OTP Mobile Number), and official portal outbound link.\n  - Closed modal cleanly.\n\n---\n\n#### 8. AI Agronomist Chat Drawer & Simulated Voice Input\n- **Drawer Opening:** Triggered via floating action button `Ask Krishi AI`.\n- **Quick Prompt Chip:** Clicked `\"Best fertilizer for paddy in clay soil?\"`.\n  - Assistant delivered formatted, agronomic breakdown of basal vs top dressing doses, micronutrients, and drainage milestones.\n- **Simulated Voice Input:**\n  - Clicked microphone button (`Voice Input / Speech-to-Text`).\n  - Pulsing voice state activated (`Listening to your voice...`).\n  - Speech was transcribed into query *\"What is the best fertilizer for paddy in clay soil?\"* and automatically answered by the AI Agronomist.\n\n---\n\n#### 9. Visual Integrity, Console & Network Inspection\n- **Console Errors:** `0` runtime JavaScript errors or unhandled exceptions logged.\n- **Broken Images:** All 7 image assets (Unsplash crop profiles and pathological leaf samples) loaded with valid dimensions and 200 HTTP statuses.\n- **Layout & Responsiveness:** Clean styling with Tailwind typography, rounded cards, micro-animations, accessible color contrast, and proper modal overlays.\n\nAll features and user flows function correctly with excellent performance and design fidelity.\n</SYSTEM_MESSAGE>"}
